<p>Allows you to dual wield any type of one handed weapons, and increases the damage of the off-hand weapon to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">57%, 65%, 70%, 73%, 76%.</acronym></p><p>Also, casting a spell (which uses a turn) will give a free melee attack at a random target in melee range for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">42%, 51%, 58%, 64%, 70%</acronym> blight damage.</p>